// Signing configuration.
//
// Kept in an xcconfig rather than in project.yml so that a team selected here
// (or in Xcode's Signing & Capabilities tab) survives the next
// `xcodegen generate` instead of being overwritten.
//
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM is the 10-character Team ID that owns the
// org.surajshetty.humapp App ID — the one with the MusicKit service enabled.
// Find it at developer.apple.com → Membership, or in Xcode's Signing tab.
//
// Leave it empty for Simulator work: Simulator builds do not need a team, and
// MusicKit does not function there in any case (DECISIONS M-09). It is
// required only for device builds, which is where Phases 1, 3, 5 and 6 live.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
